      "instance_name": "media_bias_concept",
      "label": "Media Bias Concept",
      "description": "The meme critiques media bias by implying that the media disproportionately blames Black people for violence, suggesting this is a flawed or oversimplified narrative. This concept of media bias is not visually depicted but is central to the meme's message and requires real-world knowledge about how media narratives can perpetuate racial stereotypes.",
