      "description": "The meme uses the phrase 'we've forgotten the crackers!' as a satirical metaphor to imply that the media's focus on Black people's violence is so narrow that it overlooks other important factors. The 'crackers' symbolize a trivial or overlooked aspect of the discussion, which requires understanding of metaphorical language and satirical irony to interpret correctly.",
