      "description": "The meme's humor and critique rely on the idea that by 'forgetting the crackers,' the media is minimizing or trivializing the real issues behind racialized violence. This concept of minimizing stereotypes requires understanding of how media narratives can oversimplify complex social problems.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
