      "description": "The woman's neutral-to-surprised facial expression, combined with the absurdity of the cracker metaphor, conveys a satirical form of disgust or exasperation toward the media's oversimplified narrative. The emotion is not genuine disgust but a performative reaction to the meme's critique of media bias and racialized violence narratives.",
